WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.490 line:73%
6 kWp na solar, 6 kW na
inverter. Pareho ba 'yan?

c02
00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.610 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:14.850 line:73%
Hindi. Ang kWp ay DC rating
ng panels sa test conditions.

c04
00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:20.580 line:73%
Ang kW ng inverter ay AC
output na kaya nitong ilabas.

c05
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.470 line:73%
Puwedeng mas malaki ang
panels kaysa inverter.

c06
00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.070 line:73%
Tinatawag itong
DC-to-AC ratio.

c07
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:29.720 line:73%
Kapag sobra ang DC sa
tanghali, may clipping.

c08
00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:33.670 line:73%
Normal 'yan, basta tama
ang design at kalkula.

cz1
00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:39.460 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:42.210 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
